{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL1NvdXRoX0luZGlhbi9IaW5kaS1EdWJiZWQvMjAwMC0tMjAxNS9TdHlsZSUyMCUyODIwMDYlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Style","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/4E1QNgZK0UwbN6wnz861l2BLyl1.jpg","description":"Ganesh (Prabhu Deva) is a good dancer. He beats Anthony in one dance competition to head into international arena. Anthony gets Ganesh beaten up, and Ganesh loses his legs in a car accident. He is depressed, but he wants to give his dance talent to someone and make him his heir. On a different line, Raghava (Raghava Lawrence) works as a boy at a dance school in Vizag. He and four of his friends are good dancers, but they are never recognized until one folk dance at a hotel. Ganesh finds his prospective heir in Raghava. The rest of the film is how Raghava prepares and defeats Anthony in the final dance competition.","releaseInfo":"2006","genres":["Family","Drama","South Indian"],"imdbRating":"5.9","runtime":"160 min","cast":["Raghava Lawrence","Prabhu Deva","Charmy Kaur","Kamalinee Mukherjee","Raja","Vernon Enthiado","Bhanuchander","Kalpana Chowdary"],"director":["Raghava Lawrence"],"released":"2006-01-12T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Raghava Lawrence","character":"Raghava","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vFeHxXlJsqEH2NOTRqiFZ0VRZen.jpg"},{"name":"Prabhu Deva","character":"Ganesh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lfVxoyweEPkIu6zFa44ajPuSJA1.jpg"},{"name":"Charmy Kaur","character":"Shruti","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5BIGQIuyylSpKrQVhYEEY6GfaUw.jpg"},{"name":"Kamalinee Mukherjee","character":"Priya, Ganesh's sister","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xoOdHUgXUAIzsrCgAwSsXT9pXrE.jpg"},{"name":"Raja","character":"Raja","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ibHIlBmK6GLEKQPQd43YX0i9C8d.jpg"},{"name":"Vernon Enthiado","character":"Anthony"},{"name":"Bhanuchander","character":"Raghava's father","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wOGSHy867uQB6xHbQ9A7yFEUO4